                                                "sense_id": "d6da18e5-0941-3feb-a9c1-532416924090",
                                                "text": "Mr Sumption said: \"The object would be to enable the Secretary of State to reconsider the decision, not simply so as to consider the reduction in the scope of the extradition proceedings which arises from the decision of the House of Lords, but to consider whether, in the light of that reduction, it would be right to issue an ATP (authorisation to proceed) at all.\""
