                                                "sense_id": "d91593ea-bcd0-33a2-8987-8a0e67b37992",
                                                "text": "Industry planners and analysts are closely parsing July’s numbers to try to divine what’s ahead for the industry. One worrisome sign was the decline in the average transaction price, or ATP, paid by the typical buyer in July."
